# Credentials kept beside the project.
#
# These were committed once, before the repo had a remote, and had to be taken
# back out: an OAuth client secret, a GitHub token, an API key and a set of
# recovery codes. Nothing that opens an account belongs in a repository that is
# about to become public, however convenient it is to keep it next to the thing
# it configures.
OAuth2.txt
recovery-codes.md
